  {
   "id": "schizophrenia-340137@major-2025-11-26",
   "gameId": "schizophrenia-340137",
   "displayName": "Optimization update (learn more about S.O.S achievement & THECOURGET)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-26T02:07:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update is available for SCHIZOPHRENIA.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch note",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Optimized the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed raining glass shader",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed textures not showing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed camera movement issue (weird camera movements)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added context before second flashback",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Discord RPC issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "An announcement should come in a few weeks about the S.O.S achievement and something more important, I can't and won't say nothing now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Also, a minor update about me",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "THECOURGET is now a French company, I'm really happy because I waited that since July, and my dream is coming true. I hope that 2026 is going to be a great year, SCHIZOPHRENIA was an introduction, and you will finally be able to discover what comes next.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "However, THECOURGET being a company does not mean that the team will grow, or that the games will become AAA titles. I will always keep the indie vibe. I've always loved that.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The next update is going to be big.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "THECOURGET.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
